cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this lab for teaching or training, please cite it as below."
title: "The Norvela GRC Lab: a self-hosted governance, risk and compliance training environment"
abstract: >-
  A 12-week, hands-on GRC programme built around one fictional EU payment
  institution, covering risk assessment, scoping, control testing, third-party
  risk, the DORA Register of Information, incident classification, board
  reporting and interview preparation across DORA, NIS2, GDPR, PCI DSS,
  ISO/IEC 27001, SOC 2 and the EU AI Act.
type: software
authors:
